THEORY Ex5Q2
IMPORT-THEORY Equality
IMPORT-THEORY Boolean
IMPORT-THEORY Arithmetic
IMPORT-THEORY List
IMPORT-HASKELL List
IMPORT-HASKELL Ex5
THEOREM ex5q2
   frec 23 == 42

STRATEGY ReduceLHS
  frec 23
  = DEF frec.1
  if 23 <= 7 then 4 else 23 + frec (23 - 8)
  = DEF frec.1
  if 23 <= 7 then 4 else 23 + (if 23-8 <= 7 then 4 else 23-8 + frec(23-8-8))
  = DEF frec.1
  if 23 <= 7 then 4 else 23 + (if 23-8 <= 7 then 4 else 23-8 + (if 23-8-8 <= 7 then 4 else 23-8-8+frec(23-8-8-8)))
  = SIMP
  if False then 4 else 23 + (if False then 4 else 15 + (if True then 4 else 7+frec(-1)))
  = IF 2
  23 + (if False then 4 else 15 + (if True then 4 else 7+frec(-1)))
  = IF 2
  23 + (15 + (if True then 4 else 7 + frec(-1)))
  = IF 1
  23 + (15 + 4)
  = SIMP
  42
END ReduceLHS
QED ex5q2